      "name_note": "OSM has no way literally named 'Rua Beltrao'. The closest, verified real street is 'Rua Doutor Beltrao' (osm way ids 182630122 + 785117600), a residential street in the Santa Rosa neighbourhood of Niteroi-RJ. OSM's own data carries an editorial note on both ways ('Please confirm name: Rua vs Travessa') flagging uncertainty about whether it should be 'Rua' or 'Travessa'. A separate, different street named 'Travessa Beltrao' (way id 182630104) also exists about 250m to the northeast and was NOT used as the origin - do not confuse the two.",
