      "query_1_purpose": "Fetch exact geometry of the 2 way-segments forming Rua Doutor Beltrao by OSM id (ids obtained from a prior Nominatim search: https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org/search?q=Rua+Beltr%C3%A3o,+Niter%C3%B3i,+RJ,+Brasil&format=json), plus the neighbouring Travessa Beltrao for disambiguation.",
