      "tile_size_rationale": "10m/tile chosen so a typical Brazilian residential street (7-10m carriageway+sidewalks) occupies about 1 tile width, keeping streets walkable as a single lane in the isometric grid without inflating the map. Matches classic tile-RPG scale conventions.",
      "query_radius_m": 600,
      "query_radius_rationale": "600m radius around the origin gives a believable multi-block neighbourhood context (well within the 500m-1km range) while keeping the Overpass query and resulting grid small enough to be practical.",
